# German UI & write safety

- All user-visible strings in **German** (labels, buttons, errors, status, dialogs).
- Confirm first write with „Wirklich schreiben?“; abort = no Modbus write.
- Read-only parameters must not be editable.
- Show connection status, last successful poll time, and Active Setpoints panel.
- Group navigation must include **Heizkreis 1** and **Heizkreis 2**.
- Mark stale/error values clearly when offline or after partial poll failure.
